{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You stand amidst the ruins of war. The world is running out of nutrients and it's your job to make them. Design. Build. Execute. Restore the world to what it once was. Uncover the truths of your own past.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045900/extras/photochemstore12.gif?t=1741381061\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> \u25a0 INVENT YOUR OWN SOLUTIONS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No solution is predetermined. Utilize your own creativity and critical thinking to invent a mechanism that has never been made before. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> \u25a0 UNCOVER YOUR PAST </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every robot has a creator. What were you really designed for? What comes next? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> \u25a0 EXPAND YOUR TOOLKIT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new parts which increase the number of ways you can express your creativity and make the most challenging levels manageable.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045900/extras/photochemstore22.gif?t=1741381061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3045900?t=1741381061","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045900/b832e4a58fcf9608f3441a796ce4462aceac1a54/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741381061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045900/f4cce23612086dd4ea7bea67f614fd29c8d9042a/capsule_231x87